                "name": "X-Request-Id",
                "value": ""
              }
            ]
          },
          "docs": "Update job request to refresh and purge edge application instances matching selection criteria. Update edge application instance(s) to the latest version of the edge application. This operation will result in loss of data and a restart of the edge application instance(s). "
        },
        {
